Package: sane-backend-canon-chmp
Version: 0.1.4
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libsane1, libjpeg-turbo8, python3
Maintainer: Canon CHMP SANE contributors <canon-chmp-sane@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Experimental SANE backend for Canon CHMP network scanners
 Bridges the reverse-engineered Canon CHMP client for PIXMA G3010-series
 scanners into SANE frontends such as Simple Scan. Experimental, single-page
 flatbed scans only.
